JobDescription = Position: Frontend Developer (React.js)
Company: NimbusTech Pvt Ltd
Location: Pune, India (Hybrid)
Experience Required: 1–3 years

About the Role:
We're looking for a Frontend Developer who is passionate about building intuitive, 
high-performance web applications. You'll work closely with designers, backend 
engineers, and product managers to ship features used by thousands of users.

Responsibilities:
- Develop and maintain responsive web applications using React.js
- Collaborate with UI/UX designers to translate designs into functional components
- Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability
- Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code
- Integrate RESTful APIs and work with backend teams on data contracts
- Participate in code reviews and contribute to engineering best practices

Requirements:
- 1–3 years of experience with React.js and modern JavaScript (ES6+)
- Strong understanding of HTML5, CSS3, and responsive design principles
- Experience with state management (Redux, Context API, or similar)
- Familiarity with REST APIs and asynchronous programming
- Knowledge of version control (Git)
- Bonus: Experience with Node.js, Express, MongoDB (full MERN stack)
- Bonus: Experience with testing frameworks (Jest, React Testing Library)

Soft Skills:
- Good communication and ability to work in a cross-functional team
- Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail
- Ability to manage time effectively and meet deadlines